
# KL DriveNow – React Car Rental Project

## Project Description

KL DriveNow is a React-based Car Rental
Management System.

## Features

- Home page
- Explore available cars
- Search and filter vehicles
- Customer login
- Admin login
- Car booking
- Pickup and return dates
- Payment demo
- Booking confirmation
- Booking history
- Admin dashboard
- Vehicle availability management

## Technologies

- HTML
- CSS
- React JS
- JavaScript
- Vite
- Lucide React
- Browser Local Storage

## Installation

Open the project folder in Visual Studio Code.

Run:

npm install

## Start Project

npm run dev

Open the local URL shown in the terminal.

## Demo Admin Login

